<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 4.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 4.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, April 4 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   04.04.97	  03.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.5550	 6.5868</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3903	 2.3937</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6494	 4.6584</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2585	 3.2706</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5227	 0.5268</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7966	 0.8032</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2987	 0.2993</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.9103	 6.9114</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6965	 0.6970</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.3007	 1.3030</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
